<newsitem itemid="204612" id="root" date="1996-11-20" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Goldman sets Deutsche Telekom warrants.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets Deutsche Telekom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued five million European-style COOL (Chance Of Optimum Leverage) call warrants, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    33.00 DEM		 PREMIUM	29.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.80 DEM		  GEARING	3.37 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.AUG.97		 PAYDATE	22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  33.00 DEM</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
